<h2 id="reviews">Reviews</h2>
<h3>Round 1 (Oct 1) — Codex "not ready"; Claude "ready after fixes"</h3>
<table>
<tr><th>Finding</th><th>Resolution</th></tr>
<tr><td>The operation list isn't a reliable idempotency record; lost replies; <code>maxInstances</code> isn't a lock; two runs could share a prefix (Codex blocking; Claude should-fix)</td><td>V7 rewritten: the bucket's complete folders are the record, the list is only "still running", a fresh prefix per export, capped paging that throws. Christie: allow a rare second complete copy (O5).</td></tr>
<tr><td>V-5's failure test couldn't fail: V-4 already left a success for the week (Codex blocking)</td><td>The failure test moved first, into V-4's bootstrap (steps 6–8). V-5 is the freshness test.</td></tr>
<tr><td>The "agent not created yet" path was circular (Codex blocking)</td><td>The agent is granted in V-4 after the first (failing) export creates it; the denied principal must match the Import/Export page.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Scheduler attestation is after the fact; missing audience/body/headers/complete list; the Phase E gate needs all three fields (Codex blocking; Claude should-fix)</td><td>V2 extended; limit stated; pause-first rule; no V-4 on a Sunday; the gate names all three fields.</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>onSchedule</code> can't set <code>x-tinker-reached</code> (both)</td><td>O6: narrow exception, recorded in V-2.</td></tr>
