I’ve confirmed the rewrite maps every round‑1 item in its Reviews table. I’m now checking whether those resolutions are technically sound—especially Scheduler retry identity, Firestore LRO enumeration, and whether the proposed declaration schema fits the current guard’s actual assumptions.
